OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for #75m hotel
OL,4,Aproject in Torquay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #75m hotel project on the seafront in
OL,7,FTorquay has been granted planning
OL,8,Fpermission.
OL,10,FTorbay Council put in the planning
OL,11,Fapplication for the development
OL,12,Foverlooking the harbour with 150
OL,13,Fbedrooms, a rooftop bar and ground
OL,14,Ffloor shops and restaurants.
OL,16,FSome residents objected to the plans
OL,17,Fwith claims the hotel was too big and
OL,18,Fwould not fit in to the surrounding
OL,19,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
