OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for #75m hotel
OL,4,Aproject in Torquay
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the development was approved by the
OL,7,Fcouncil's planning committee on
OL,8,FWednesday and the council will now work
OL,9,Fto make a deal with a developer and a
OL,10,Fhotel firm to deliver the scheme.
